        ("/**\n * Set based Multimap. Doesn't allow duplications for values mapped to key.\n *\n * @author Nikita Koksharov\n *\n * @param <K> key\n * @param <V> value\n */", '/**\n * 基于 Set 的 Multimap；同一键下值不可重复。\n *\n * @author Nikita Koksharov\n *\n * @param <K> 键类型\n * @param <V> 值类型\n */'),
